{:edb/db-before-t 2681 :edb/db-after-t 2682 :edb/tx-data [[13194139535994 50 #inst "2026-10-15T16:39:17.703Z" 13194139535994 17592186045417 true] [17592186166962 1038 #edb/ref 17592186553812 13194139535994 17592186045417 true] [17592186553806 1080 "III only" 13194139535994 17592186045417 true] [17592186553806 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139535994 17592186045417 true] [17592186553806 1083 #uuid "7703407d-8788-52d9-8d23-7c0dd469068b" 13194139535994 17592186045417 true] [17592186553807 1080 "I and II only" 13194139535994 17592186045417 true] [17592186553807 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139535994 17592186045417 true] [17592186553807 1083 #uuid "a7281cf1-df65-5001-bdd3-ab6876280750" 13194139535994 17592186045417 true] [17592186553808 1080 "II only" 13194139535994 17592186045417 true] [17592186553808 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139535994 17592186045417 true] [17592186553808 1083 #uuid "bd204788-03a2-5b3d-ac8e-82ebffa05caf" 13194139535994 17592186045417 true] [17592186553809 1080 "II and III only" 13194139535994 17592186045417 true] [17592186553809 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139535994 17592186045417 true] [17592186553809 1083 #uuid "c4208108-7b91-5e37-9f02-765baf72fbe9" 13194139535994 17592186045417 true] [17592186553810 1080 "I, II, and III" 13194139535994 17592186045417 true] [17592186553810 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139535994 17592186045417 true] [17592186553810 1083 #uuid "e264fdd1-c875-5ee0-914c-54600fb544c3" 13194139535994 17592186045417 true] [17592186553811 1075 #edb/ref 17592186553806 13194139535994 17592186045417 true] [17592186553811 1075 #edb/ref 17592186553807 13194139535994 17592186045417 true] [17592186553811 1075 #edb/ref 17592186553808 13194139535994 17592186045417 true] [17592186553811 1075 #edb/ref 17592186553809 13194139535994 17592186045417 true] [17592186553811 1075 #edb/ref 17592186553810 13194139535994 17592186045417 true] [17592186553811 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139535994 17592186045417 true] [17592186553811 1077 "selection" 13194139535994 17592186045417 true] [17592186553811 1078 #edb/ref 17592186553807 13194139535994 17592186045417 true] [17592186553811 1079 #uuid "5932e5d0-9d0c-54be-9a78-8ee0938071e4" 13194139535994 17592186045417 true] [17592186553812 1068 #edb/ref 17592186553811 13194139535994 17592186045417 true] [17592186553812 1069 "q-340513" 13194139535994 17592186045417 true] [17592186553812 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045487 13194139535994 17592186045417 true] [17592186553812 1071 "Let $F(x)=\\operatorname{sin}⁡x$ for $x\\in R.$ Suppose $f(x)$ is the $2\\pi $-periodic extension of $F(x)$ from $x\\in [0,2\\pi )$ to $x\\in R.$ Which of the following statements are true?\n\nI. $f(x+2\\pi )=f(x)$ for all $x\\in R$\n\nII. $f(x)=F(x)$ for all $x\\in R$\n\nIII. $f(x+\\pi )=f(x)$ for all $x\\in R$" 13194139535994 17592186045417 true] [17592186553812 1072 #uuid "5964ffcf-bc61-5cdb-8ce3-fe3d629e8c05" 13194139535994 17592186045417 true] [17592186553812 1074 "Since $f$ is the $2\\pi $-periodic extension of $F,$ we have \n\n- $f(x+2\\pi )=f(x)$ for all $x\\in R,$ and\n\n- $f(x)=F(x)$ for all $x\\in [0,2\\pi ).$\n\nWith that in mind, let's examine our statements in turn.\n\n- Statement I is true. This is exactly the definition of $2\\pi $-periodicity:\n\n$$\nf(x+2\\pi )=f(x)\n$$\n\nfor all $x\\in R.$\n\n- Statement II is true. Notice that $F$ itself is $2\\pi $-periodic, because for any $x\\in R,$ we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}F(x+2\\pi )=\\operatorname{sin}⁡(x+2\\pi )=\\operatorname{sin}⁡(x)=F(x).\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSince $F$ already satisfies the periodicity rule, the $2\\pi $-periodic extension agrees with $F$ everywhere, so $f(x)=F(x)$ for all $x\\in R.$\n\n- Statement III is false. For example, take $x=\\frac{\\pi }{2}.$ Then,\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}f(\\frac{\\pi }{2}+\\pi )=f(\\frac{3\\pi }{2})=F(\\frac{3\\pi }{2})=-1,\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nwhile\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}f(\\frac{\\pi }{2})=F(\\frac{\\pi }{2})=1.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is \"I only\"." 13194139535994 17592186045417 true]] :edb/tempids {"answer-7703407d-8788-52d9-8d23-7c0dd469068b" 17592186553806 "answer-a7281cf1-df65-5001-bdd3-ab6876280750" 17592186553807 "answer-bd204788-03a2-5b3d-ac8e-82ebffa05caf" 17592186553808 "answer-c4208108-7b91-5e37-9f02-765baf72fbe9" 17592186553809 "answer-e264fdd1-c875-5ee0-914c-54600fb544c3" 17592186553810 "answer-field-5932e5d0-9d0c-54be-9a78-8ee0938071e4" 17592186553811 "question-5964ffcf-bc61-5cdb-8ce3-fe3d629e8c05" 17592186553812} :edb/committed false :edb/speculative true}
